# Taz_2G
{620}{}{I handle the butchery work around here and also tan some of the skins we send out. The doctors claim that I made up this story after running through a forcefield and frying my brain cells. They're telling me all sorts of nonsense, like how I'm not in my beloved Porto but in some place called Tibbets. Can you believe that? What's wrong with them?}
