{892}{}{Can I ask you about something else?}
{893}{}{Alright, take care for now.}

# Taz_5_2
{920}{}{We sell to Boneyard, Hub, Fort Aradesh, and Hoover Dam.}
{921}{}{What can you tell me about Boneyard?}
{922}{}{What can you tell me about Hub?}
{923}{}{What can you tell me about Fort Aradesh?}
