# Taz_5_3a_1
{950}{}{Boneyard? It's a large settlement built upon the ruins of a pre-war metropolis. It's teeming with people, which means a lot of hungry mouths to feed.}
{951}{}{Can you tell me how to get there?}
{952}{}{What can you tell me about Hoover Dam?}

# Taz_5_3a_2
{980}{}{No, I've never been there myself. As far as I know, it's southwest of Hoover Dam. Your best bet would be to ask the merchants who travel there for directions.}
{981}{}{I see. Can I ask you about something else?}
{982}{}{Alright, I'll leave you be. Take care.}

# Taz_5_3b_1
{1010}{}{Hub is a place that exists because it possesses the largest source of a precious commodity in the wasteland.}
{1011}{}{What's that?}
{1012}{}{Water?}

# Taz_5_3b_2a
{1040}{}{Water, my friend. Abundant, clean drinking water.}
{1041}{}{What does Hub produce that it can trade with you?}

# Taz_5_3b_2b
{1070}{}{That's correct. No flies on you! Fresh, clean drinking water.}

# Taz_5_3b_3
{1100}{}{That very same precious water. We have enough here to feed the cattle, but it's not of high enough quality for people, especially with the growth of some western towns.}
{1101}{}{Can you tell me how to get to Hub?}

# Taz_5_3b_4
{1130}{}{No, I'm afraid I don't know the way. It's a dangerous area due to the demand for water. I've also heard rumors of strange occurrences there.}
{1131}{}{Could you at least give me a rough idea of its location?}

# Taz_5_3b_5
{1160}{}{Sure, it's located west of Hoover Dam, I believe. If you really need directions, ask the caravan workers who travel there.}

# Taz_5_3c_1
{1190}{}{Terrible place, that Fort Aradesh. There's a fortune in pre-war tech lying around there, but the pollution from the oil refinery is so intense that no one survives there for long.}

# Taz_5_3c_2
{1220}{}{I can; from all the stories I've heard, I know the place all too well. But I won't. I've lost too many friends to that place, and I don't want the responsibility of your death.}
{1221}{}{And if I cross your palm with five caps?}
{1222}{}{Don't make me hurt you, Taz. Tell me.}
{1223}{}{Taz, I've got plenty of medical supplies. I've dealt with "hot" places before. You can tell me.}
{1224}{}{I see. Can I ask you something else?}


# Taz_5_3c_3a
{1250}{}{No! I'm not trying to squeeze every last cap out of you! Seriously, just steer clear of that place if you've got any sense.}

